xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p>翻出几年前在美国时候的 Instagram 照片，我发现那时的天空里已经有这些东西，只是没有伦敦这么多。当时我对此一无所知，然而我却欣赏着当时的美景，仍然快乐地活了这么久。也许有一天我会因此得癌症或者“传染病”，但要是我像以前一样一无所知，也就认命了。世界上这么多人都跟我一样呼吸着这样的东西，某些很有价值的人将来也会因此得癌症或“传染病”，会死。我有什么特别遗憾的呢？</p><p>路过唐宁街 10 号（英国首相府）门口的时候，我看到抗议人士在马路对面挂着横幅，揭露“全球变暖”等骗局，揭露Bills Gates，Anthony Fauci 这些反人类的罪犯。如果是几年前，我肯定以为他们在胡言乱语，然而现在我却明白，他们也许真懂得一些事情。虽然他们也有可能是 Matrix 的“反面角色”演员，故意要用一些夸张的说法让人们不相信这些事。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:480,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:153779,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MXBo!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F510d18ac-bbe5-4ed0-9056-99dde8ace490_640x480.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s